,"rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T01:24:42-07:00","id":1102731,"title":"","content":"I am interested, but don't know yet if I can spare the time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T10:05:56-07:00","id":1102847,"title":"","content":"The setting is a city in the horizon realm, and it is mostly a ghost town. If you are looking for a place to sleep your best bet might be an abandoned building. However, the city is filled with mages. It is like Zion in the matrix, in that the technocracy doesn't know where the city is. Currently there are no NPCs or monsters to kill but that might change. Ultimately the game is about staying in character and role playing. Mages can cast deadly spells on each other, and the combat system is an important part of the game. However when and if you die, you just travel to the spirit realm, and have the opportunity to find your way back to the city and bring your character back to life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11911-corey","name":"Corey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11911_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}